 "markdown": "**Ashtakavarga chart** (South Indian style, printed page 227)\n\n```\n+-------------+-------------+-------------+-------------+\n| 0           | 000         | 0000        | 0000        |\n|             |             | 000         |             |\n+-------------+-------------+-------------+-------------+\n| 00000       |                           | 0000        |\n+-------------+                           +-------------+\n| 000         |                           | 00000       |\n+-------------+-------------+-------------+-------------+\n| 0000        | L           | 0000        | 000         |\n|             | 00000       |             |             |\n+-------------+-------------+-------------+-------------+\n```\n\nLagna is in Scorpio, so houses are counted from there.\n\n| House | Sign | Bindus |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 (Lagna) | Scorpio | 5 |\n| 2 | Sagittarius | 4 |\n| 3 | Capricorn | 3 |\n| 4 | Aquarius | 5 |\n| 5 | Pisces | 1 |\n| 6 | Aries | 3 |\n| 7 | Taurus | 7 |\n| 8 | Gemini | 4 |\n| 9 | Cancer | 4 |\n| 10 | Leo | 5 |\n| 11 | Virgo | 3 |\n| 12 | Libra | 4 |\n\nTotal bindus: **48** — the standard total for Sun."
